questions.question_text:
What is the total of the four part-products in this area model?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) rectangle (4,3);
\draw (2.5,0)--(2.5,3);
\draw (0,1.7)--(4,1.7);
\node[above] at (1.25,3) {$20$};
\node[above] at (3.25,3) {$7$};
\node[left] at (0,2.35) {$10$};
\node[left] at (0,0.85) {$6$};
\node at (1.25,2.35) {$200$};
\node at (3.25,2.35) {$70$};
\node at (1.25,0.85) {$120$};
\node at (3.25,0.85) {$42$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
